// Purpose
// Top expensive consumers.
//
// Assumptions about log schema
// Token metrics include Tenant, Product, and Model dimensions. Pricing is joined later from a reviewed cost table.
// Field names are placeholders until APIM diagnostics and custom dimensions are finalized.
//
// Query
customMetrics
| where name == "Total Tokens"
| extend Tenant = tostring(customDimensions["Tenant"]), Product = tostring(customDimensions["Product"]), Model = tostring(customDimensions["Model"])
| summarize TotalTokens = sum(value) by Tenant, Product, Model
| top 20 by TotalTokens desc
//
// TODOs
// - Replace custom dimension names with the exact emitted telemetry fields.
// - Confirm whether token metrics are stored in customMetrics, traces, or both.
// - Add workspace, environment, and region filters before production use.
